%N A398539 Square array T(n, m) read by antidiagonals downwards: T(n, m) is the m-th n-Knödel number, for n >= 1 and m >= 1.
%H A398539 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kn%C3%B6del_number">Knödel number</a>
%e A398539 Square array begins:
%e A398539       |     1     2     3     4     5     6     7
%e A398539 ------+------------------------------------------
